---
import PublicLayout from "@/layouts/PublicLayout.astro";
---

<PublicLayout title="视频作品" description="杨振的 AI 漫剧与短视频作品，记录创作过程和实践。">
  <section class="container max-w-5xl py-10 lg:py-16">
    <header class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-muted-foreground">VIDEO · 视频作品</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">把想法做成视频</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">
        AI 短片与创作实验。这里记录作品，也记录从想法到成片的过程。
      </p>
    </header>

    <article class="mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.85fr)_minmax(0,1.15fr)] md:items-center md:gap-12">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-black shadow-sm">
        <video
          class="block max-h-[78svh] w-full object-contain"
          controls
          playsinline
          preload="none"
          poster="/videos/hengwen-an-poster.jpg"
          aria-label="鉴画师收下新徒"
        >
          <source src="/media/videos/hengwen-an.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>

      <div class="py-2">
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">AI 漫剧 <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> 清河镇 · 旧事</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">鉴画师收下新徒</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
          我的第一部 AI 漫剧短片，记录一次从创意到成片的创作实践。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <span>时长 3:14</span>
          <a class="font-medium text-foreground underline-offset-4 hover:underline" href="/media/videos/hengwen-an.mp4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            单独打开视频 ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</PublicLayout>
